	(text "=====================================\nSYSTEM POWER BUDGET & STEPPER DRAW PROOF\n=====================================\n- Primary Input: 24VDC Nominal\n- Max Design Power Draw: 100W (4.16A @ 24V)\n\nSTEPPER CURRENT STEP-DOWN CALCULATION (Per Motor):\n- Coil Specs: 2.0A Max per phase, ~2.5V Drop (5W/phase)\n- Max Motor Power: 2 phases * 5W = 10W per motor\n- Driver Efficiency: ~85% -> 10W / 0.85 = 11.7W from 24V\n- Line Current (1 Motor): 11.7W / 24V = ~0.49A\n- Total Draw (4 Motors): 4 * 0.49A = 1.96A continuous\n\nSYSTEM ALLOCATION:\n- 4x NEMA 17 Motors: 1.96A continuous (~47W)\n- Logic, Fans, & Transient Headroom: 2.2A (~53W)\n- CRITICAL: No heated beds or 24V spindles allowed.\n=====================================\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 13.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "35be89e6-017b-40a1-9d12-027b16ad7482")
	)
